|~ The verbs of explanations [D98]. Each resides on
   `::qlang/explanation`, the kind of what `explain` answers: the page of
   an error's site and the error itself. ~|

:doc
  |~~ The page of the error's site [D7], the doc of the tag it shows.

      ~("x" | add 1 !| explain | doc | eq (::AddLeftNotNumberError | docs | first))
  ~~|
  ::verb~(:returns ::doc | /doc)

:error
  |~~ The error the explanation explains, the one `!|` opened, a value
      on the success track that `raise` raises again [D97].

      ~("x" | add 1 !| explain | error | /actualType | eq ::string)
      ~("x" | add 1 !| explain | error | raise !| type | eq ::AddLeftNotNumberError)
  ~~|
  ::verb~(/error)
